["A Cait Calls"]={description="Mission Orders: Cait Sith would speak to you about a matter of utmost importance. Make haste for the Pashhow Marshlands of the past and rendezvous with the ever-enigmatic feline.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=84,next={"The Truth Is Out There"},previous={"VW Op. 126: Qufim Incursion"},start_pos="J-9",start_zone="Pashhow Marshlands (S)"},
["A Farewell to Felines"]={description="Mission Orders: On the verge of unraveling the Voidwalker enigma, Kupofried suffered a shocking setback...the sudden disappearance of his feline cohort. What nefarious force whisked Cait Sith across the dimensional threshold? The plot ever thickens...",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=91,next={"Third Tour of Duchy"},previous={"Between a Rock and Rift"},start_npc="Voidwatch Officer"},
