["A World in Flux"]={description="Mission Orders: Little to your surprise, the Allied Nations of Crystal War-era Vana'diel are also at wit's end with the Voidwalker menace. Make your way to Vunkerl Inlet, Grauberg, and Fort Karugo-Narugo and dispatch any fiends that may emerge from the rifts.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=89,next={"Between a Rock and Rift"},previous={"No Rest for the Weary"},reward="30,000 gil"},
