["At Journey's End"]={description="Lost souls scarred by the past strive toward their vision of a brighter future... When fates converge, a new chapter of history will unfold. Is this the end of their journey, or but a new beginning? Look to the starry heavens and your answer may be found...",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=63,previous={"Manifest Destiny"},reward="Zodiac Ring",start_npc="Lehko Habhoka",start_zone="Castle Oztroja (S)",title="Star in the Azure Sky"},
["Battle on a New Front"]={description="Mission Orders: You have been cleared to participate in the Jeuno region Voidwatch operation. Go forth and quell the Voidwalker menace!",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=82,next={"VW Op. 126: Qufim Incursion"},previous={"Drafted by the Duchy"},reward="[Key Item] White stratum abyssite III\n[Key Item] Voidwatcher's emblem: Qufim\n30,000 Gil"},
["Beans Ahoy!"]={description="Grounded fisherman Thierride is in search of a seasoning that will allow him to make the most mouth-watering bean dish in Vana'diel.",fame="Crystal War",id=29,previous={"Lufet's Lake Salt"},repeatable="No",requirements={{count=2,id=1019,name="Lufet Salt"}},reward="Angler's Cassoulet",start_npc="Thierride",start_pos="F-8",start_zone="Southern San d'Oria",title="Seasoning Connoisseur"},
["Beast from the East"]={description="The task of ascertaining what truths or falsehoods might lie behind the legend of the so-called Mountain's Eye has fallen to you. At the behest of studious Nichais, make haste to the wilds of Grauberg and find what secrets may await...",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=30,repeatable="No",requirements={{count=1,id=17397,name="Shell Bug"}},reward="2 of the following: Black Pearl, Chrysoberyl, Jadeite, Ametrine, Zircon, Goshenite, Sphene, Fluorite, Peridot, Garnet, Turquoise, Painite, Sunstone, Moonstone, Pearl.",start_npc="Nichais",start_pos="L-7",start_zone="Southern San d'Oria",title="Wyrmsworn Protector"},
["Beneath the Mask"]={description="Disgraced by the actions of the traitorous Captain Klara, the Mythril Musketeers have been relegated to serve in penal detachments. The mood turns darker still with the news that Zeid has deserted the ranks. Travel to Beadeaux to learn what you can from his commanding officer.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=49,next={"What Price Loyalty"},previous={"Honor Under Fire"},requirements={{count=1,name="Beeswax and Red Textile Dye"}},reward="Super Reraiser",start_npc="Gentle Tiger",start_pos="H-6",start_zone="Bastok Markets"},
