["Between a Rock and Rift"]={description="Mission Orders: Could it be that the Walk of Echoes holds the key to the enigma that is the Voidwalker menace? With no word from Cait Sith or the mysterious moogle Kupofried, you decide to head to the Pashhow Marshlands rendezvous point to investigate...",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=90,next={"A Farewell to Felines"},previous={"A World in Flux"},start_pos="J-9",start_zone="Pashhow Marshlands (S)"},
["Blood of Heroes"]={description="Count Aurchiat lies dead, felled in an Orcish ambush that has left the Cardinal Stags severely weakened deep in the heart of enemy territory. The key to survival lies in a joint operation with the Iron Rams...",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=52,next={"Chasing Shadows"},previous={"Songbirds in a Snowstorm"},reward="Ram Staff",start_npc="Excenmille",start_zone="Xarcabard (S)",title="House Aurchiat Retainer"},
["Bonds That Never Die"]={description="Determined not to let Machegue's death be in vain, Excenmille has disobeyed his father's direct orders and embarked on a solitary mission to slay the behemoth. Follow him to Jugner Forest and ensure his safety!",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=45,next={"Songbirds in a Snowstorm"},previous={"The Price of Valor"},requirements={{count=1,name="Hatchets, for logging."}},reward="Behemoth Horn",start_npc="Cyranuce",start_zone="Pashhow Marshlands (S)",title="Honorary Knight of the Cardinal Stag"},
["Bonds of Mythril"]={description="Fighting alongside ghastly demons one moment, risking her life to defend you the next... What is Captain Klara's true connection to the armies of shadow? Return to the site of your confrontation, that long sought-after truths may at last be revealed!",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=59,previous={"The Truth Lies Hid"},reward="Excelsis Ring",start_npc="Volker",start_zone="Castle Zvahl Baileys (S)",title="Temperer of Mythril"},
