["Face of the Future"]={description="Your latest encounter with Zogbog has led to you being hurled through time. No sooner had you awakened in present day Vana'diel than Iron Ram Engineer Bostillette appeared to entreat your aid. Make your way to base camp in the Jugner Forest if you would know more.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=61,previous={"Chasing Shadows"},reward="Griffon Ring",start_npc="Bostillette",start_zone="Batallia Downs (S)",title="Fangmonger Forestaller"},
