["Hammering Hearts"]={description="A new type of Quadav armor has been causing tension in the military. Ghemp wants a heavy Quadav chestplate and heavy Quadav backplate for analysis. Obtain and deliver the items to Scarred Shark for a reward.",fame="Crystal War",id=14,requirements={{count=1,id=2504,name="H. Qdv. Chestplate"},{count=1,id=2505,name="H. Qdv. Backplate"}},reward="Trainee Hammer",start_npc="Scarred Shark",start_zone="Bastok Markets (S)"},
["Healing Herbs"]={description="Maju-Naju's research has ground to a halt. He needs research materials that are hard to find in this day and age...",id=3,reward="Tincture",start_npc="Rhinostery",start_pos="J-8",start_zone="Windurst Waters",title="None"},
["Her Memories: Carnelian/Azure/Verdure"]={description="These are mutually exclusive quests — only one can be completed per character. Lilisette sought admission into one of three nations' military forces. Follow her footsteps to discover whether her attempt was successful.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=69,previous={"Her Memories"},reward="[Key Item] Large memory fragment",start_zone="Southern San d'Oria (S), Bastok Markets (S), or Windurst Waters (S)"},
["Her Memories: Grave Resolve"]={description="Despite no longer having memories of Lilisette, Halver's words spoken from his subconscious suggest that not all is lost. Could the Larzos of your reality possess knowledge that would aid your cause? Make haste to where he and you first met, at Sir Ragelise's gravestone.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=67,previous={"Her Memories: Homecoming Queen"},requirements={{count=1,id=956,name="Lilac"}},reward="[Key Item] Tiny memory fragment",start_npc="Halver",start_pos="I-9",start_zone="Chateau d'Oraguille"},
