["Her Memories: The Faux Pas"]={description="The Elvaan gentleman you saw praying at the cathedral apparently seeks atonement for his callous treatment of a \"red-haired maiden.\" Could there be a connection between him and Lilisette? The friar informs you that the man might be found at Laborman's Way.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=66,previous={"Her Memories: Homecoming Queen"},reward="[Key Item] Tiny memory fragment",start_npc="Abioleget",start_zone="Northern San d'Oria"},
["Honor Under Fire"]={description="A disconsolate Five Moons has departed for the Vunkerl Inlet, driven by the desire to attain closure over the death of his former hero and role model, Darksteel Hurricane. Follow your Mythril Musketeer comrade and offer him support in this time of need.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=43,next={"Beneath the Mask"},previous={"Quelling the Storm"},reward="Elixir Tank",start_npc="Gentle Tiger",start_pos="H-6",start_zone="Bastok Markets",title="Detector of Deception"},
["Howl from the Heavens"]={description="As the battered Federation forces prepare to defend their city from the approaching hordes, the inscrutable Robel-Akbel schemes in his dark chambers. What terrible secrets lie behind his mask? Deliver the magicite he seeks, and long-sought truths just may be revealed...",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=54,next={"Manifest Destiny"},previous={"Sins of the Mothers"},reward="Cobra Staff",start_npc="Robel-Akbel",start_zone="Windurst Waters (S)",title="The Moon's Companion"},
["In a Haze of Glory"]={description="Despite heightened security, the Garlaige Citadel has been infiltrated by an unseen enemy who is emitting poisonous gas with brutal results. Amidst the confusion, zealous new captain, Rahal, has ventured off on his own. Find him and ensure he does not come to harm.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=38,next={"The Price of Valor"},previous={"Perils of the Griffon"},reward="Fullmetal Bullet",start_npc="Diordinne",start_zone="Garlaige Citadel (S)"},
