["Perils of the Griffon"]={description="As if the threat of disbandment was not enough, the Young Griffons must also fend off a determined Captain Rongelouts from confiscating their Orcish warmachine. Assist them in the desperate defense of their base!",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=37,next={"In a Haze of Glory"},previous={"Wrath of the Griffon"},reward="Elixir",start_npc="Rholont",start_pos="E-7",start_zone="Southern San d'Oria",title="Knight of the Swiftwing Griffon"},
["Provenance"]={description="Mission Orders: A place from which all radiance once shone brightly forth now dimly flickers on the brink of existence... It is here that the source of Vana'diel's suffering dwells, say the now multifarious caits.",fame="Wings of the Goddess",id=95,next={"Crystal Guardian"},previous={"Brace for the Unknown"},start_zone="Provenance"},
